              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: Irooko, ogarukye okunde ogwo mukazi orikukundwa nkunzi ye endiijo, kandi enshambani, nk'oku MUKAMA akunda Abaisraeli, n'obu baraabe bakuratira baaruhanga abandi, bakakunda ebiihuro by'emizaabibu eyomire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
