            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naamugira nti: Noija kumara ebiro bingi ori owangye; torigaruka kuraaya, n'obu kwakuba okuba omukazi w'ondiijo mushaija; kandi naanye nikwo ndiba ahariiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
